<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on Bulgari.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Bulgari.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, on Bulgari shares, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    29000.00 ITL	ISSUE PRICE     777.00 ITL</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.OCT.98	   PAYDATE	   04.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX		   MIN EXER LOT    100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  28750.00 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
